{"id":921807,"title":"11｜Word集成本地大模型：高效智能校准与润色文档","content":"本文介绍了如何在Word中通过插件调用本地大模型实现文档自动纠错和智能润色。相比在线工具，本地部署解决了数据安全和格式完整性问题。整个系统包括四部分：Word、Office AI助手插件、Ollama软件和DeepSeek大模型。首先安装Office AI助手插件，确保支持Windows平台的Office或WPS。接着下载并安装Ollama，验证其运行状态。然后从Ollama官网下载并安装DeepSeek-R1 1.5b模型，使用命令行确认安装成功。最后，在Office AI助手设置中选择本地模型框架Ollama及DeepSeek-R1 1.5b模型，保存后进行测试。通过Office AI助手，可以实现文档内容的智能校对和润色，保持原有格式不变。该方案既保证了数据安全，又提高了文档处理效率，适合企业和个人用户。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":404274,"user_name":"张文龙","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":2149411,"ip_address":"重庆","ucode":"26113DCF58CCEE","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/20/cc/23/e83ab1f9.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1766458147,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101081801,"comment_content":"不能直接修改现有格式的话，其实跟复制粘贴进去差别不大的","like_count":1},{"had_liked":false,"id":405097,"user_name":"Roway","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1060967,"ip_address":"陕西","ucode":"65AF589142AB6C","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/10/30/67/a1e9aaba.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1769965882,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":5,"score":2,"product_id":101081801,"comment_content":"联网才能用吗？","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":405076,"user_name":"Roway","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1060967,"ip_address":"陕西","ucode":"65AF589142AB6C","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/10/30/67/a1e9aaba.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1769862432,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":5,"score":2,"product_id":101081801,"comment_content":"点个赞","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":403507,"user_name":"陈国治","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1029391,"ip_address":"广东","ucode":"77DD4948976A12","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/0f/b5/0f/73f6ba94.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_cti